<title>ISRAEL: Israel blesses Clinton victory.</title>
<headline>Israel blesses Clinton victory.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel welcomed Bill Clinton's re-election as president of the United States on Wednesday, saying it expected traditionally strong relations with its main ally to continue.</p>
<p>&quot;(I convey) a blessing in the name of the government of Israel and I can say in the name of all the citizens of Israel to the President Bill Clinton,&quot; Foreign Minister David Levy told Israel's army radio.</p>
<p>&quot;I have no doubt that our relations will continue and strengthen in the future,&quot; Levy said.</p>
</text>
